B.Af=new A.f5("Gayatri Mantra","Surya","A prayer for clarity and inner light. Traditionally said at sunrise.","O divine light, our minds are clouded by darkness. Drive that darkness far from us, and awaken clarity, wisdom, and understanding within.","It is traditionally chanted at sunrise to begin the day with a clear, positive intention. The slow, steady repetition works like a focusing meditation \u2014 it lengthens the breath and quiets a busy mind \u2014 which is part of why it has been passed down for over three thousand years.",B.XY,B.Xx,B.Zu)
