B.a3v=new A.f5("Maha Mrityunjaya Mantra","Shiva","A prayer for healing, protection, and courage in hard times.","Heal me and hold me. When fear or illness grips me, let me be released from it as gently as a ripe fruit falls from the vine.","A prayer for healing, protection, and courage \u2014 often chanted for oneself or a loved one during illness or grief. Its long, resonant sounds naturally slow the breath and calm the body\u2019s stress response, which is why many people find it steadying in hard times.",B.Xj,B.XB,B.Xb)
